Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Old Acquaintance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 25
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.19,0:00:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The door is finally closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined your old place would be so cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.55,0:00:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Does anyone else live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That person has left and won’t be coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.12,0:00:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s not talk about that; hurry up and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is compressed food that won’t expire for a thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.84,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.40,0:01:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, you have a rag doll too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it a gift from someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it the person who lives here? What kind of person are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.80,0:01:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If she doesn’t want to talk about it, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.29,0:01:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,along with many others,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.32,0:01:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to scavenge for suitable parts in this desert
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.45,0:01:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,to sell to the entertainment machine factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.69,0:01:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, could you give us an advance on our water ration?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.76,0:01:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s too hot; we can’t hold out much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven’t finished your work yet—why should you get water?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don’t get water soon…We really can’t hold out any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.03,0:01:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.17,0:02:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, can you win water from the game machine here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.88,0:02:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If I win, do I get water as a reward too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.36,0:02:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. But if you lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.28,0:02:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,what do I get out of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.20,0:02:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I only have the parts I’ve collected over the last few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.19,0:02:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If I lose, I’ll give them all to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.59,0:02:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I have one go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.43,0:02:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I’ll make an exception and let you play once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.40,0:02:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Here are five rounds of ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.88,0:02:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hit five flying discs,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.84,0:02:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll just give you two bottles of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.80,0:02:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.88,0:02:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Game over. Your parts are mine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.20,0:02:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve adjusted the gun’s sights; you won’t hit a thing no matter how you shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve still got one bullet left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,if I can hit five flying discs with a single shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,can you give me an extra crate of water?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.41,0:02:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit five flying discs with one bullet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.65,0:03:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you miss,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.76,0:03:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,you’ll have to give me double the parts tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.05,0:03:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitting five flying discs with a single shot—how is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.00,0:03:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You…you…you cheated!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.21,0:03:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How did she cheat? Wasn’t that the deal you agreed on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If I say she cheated, then she cheated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.64,0:03:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to stick to the agreed-upon rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.36,0:03:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Give her the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.48,0:03:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, alright—please spare me, hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.07,0:03:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.99,0:03:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What? A shovel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.87,0:03:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.87,0:03:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.84,0:04:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.91,0:04:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, you actually have a weapon on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.67,0:04:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you use the shovel to scare him earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If weapons could solve problems,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,then the world wouldn’t have ended up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.16,0:04:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, it’s getting late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You should hurry home, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.40,0:04:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t have a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What about your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.00,0:04:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t have family either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how have you been making a living?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.88,0:04:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I help Boss scavenge for parts in the desert to trade for water and food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But he treats me so badly, that’s why I…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you might lose that job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it go, then. I wouldn’t work for someone like that anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.63,0:04:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So, would you consider working for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.36,0:04:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you digging for parts too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What I dig for isn’t parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.59,0:05:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m an archaeologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This desert is full of traces left behind by ancient civilizations,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.28,0:05:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,proving that this place was once a highly advanced world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to explore the truth behind these civilizations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We might even find clues about the water source.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t understand the details, but I find it fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But archaeology can be dangerous, you—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not afraid. Plus, I can protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.21,0:05:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You’d also have to endure harsh climates and water shortages.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.40,0:05:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.96,0:05:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And you’d have to endure the loneliness of being alone all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,With me around, you won’t be lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.85,0:05:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really want to join?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, from today on, I’m your partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have companions now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I still don’t know your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.41,0:05:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Xi’er.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.01,0:05:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi’er—I look forward to working with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.77,0:06:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Our names both contain the character “Xi”.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I still prefer calling you “Big Sister”.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Big Sister, what happened next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,After that…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, I accompanied Dr. Mei to many ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,As her assistant,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.28,0:06:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I searched all over this desert with her for clues about water sources.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.57,0:06:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Here’s a new one for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.61,0:06:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.17,0:06:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, think of a name for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.37,0:06:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope it can be used to drive away all the darkness in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s call it “Sand Shadow”.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.36,0:06:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s likely an ancient ruin hidden nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.88,0:06:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on my deciphering of the ancient script found here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.24,0:07:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,there is a laboratory from an ancient civilization buried underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.08,0:07:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This laboratory might hold clues regarding a water source.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.19,0:07:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.79,0:07:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can actually find this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.81,0:07:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,we might be able to find more water sources.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.40,0:07:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the people of this world won’t have to struggle for water anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.87,0:07:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not far from the ruins, and it offers protection from the wind and sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.03,0:07:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t we make this our campsite?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.59,0:07:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.99,0:07:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be our home from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.47,0:07:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.67,0:07:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.86,0:07:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like something is still missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:07:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it looks like a girl’s home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.44,0:08:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there’s still one thing missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.59,0:08:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This flower is…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.59,0:08:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the only thing that can bloom in this desolate desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.79,0:08:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That spirit of surviving against the odds—it perfectly represents our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.26,0:08:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.79,0:08:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.42,0:08:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you had such a wonderful companion, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.23,0:08:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s getting late; let’s get some rest while we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.23,0:08:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll set off again once the sandstorm passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.94,0:08:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a hole in this doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The hole is too big; it’s impossible to patch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.86,0:08:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.02,0:08:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can fix it using a stitching technique my mom taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry; using my unique stitching technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can patch it up right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.46,0:09:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That same stitching style…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.94,0:09:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.42,0:09:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother is Dr. Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you’re actually her daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.18,0:09:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This wound of mine…I have your mother to thank for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Big Sister gets back, we can have a meal right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.49,0:09:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.37,0:09:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I came up with a new dish today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.01,0:09:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Go pack your bags; you have to leave here immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the water source is about to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.17,0:09:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your job is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.17,0:09:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Job? Aren’t we partners?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.13,0:09:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Partners?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I pick a brat like you as a partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.17,0:09:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve always just regarded you as an assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.56,0:09:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You said this place was a home for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.58,0:09:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just using you to help me find the ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all a lie. Just leave already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.97,0:10:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t believe you’re that kind of person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.73,0:10:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don’t send me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.43,0:10:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.36,0:10:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don’t leave, don’t blame me for being harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.64,0:10:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you treating me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.15,0:10:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.23,0:10:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you treating me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.36,0:10:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,For years,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.80,0:10:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been searching for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.35,0:10:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.59,0:11:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Until recently, when a man named Guangzong suddenly found me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.68,0:11:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,and told me to bring you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I had absolutely no interest in working for someone like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.79,0:11:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But the payment he offered me was…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.91,0:11:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,information about Dr. Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.20,0:11:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I agreed to Guangzong’s request to capture Xiao Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible. My mother would never do something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.80,0:11:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then come with me to find Guangzong and get the facts straight about Dr. Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Found them. They’re right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll deal with them; you go to that spot and wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Could Mom have been captured by Guangzong and his people?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.61,0:11:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I’ll go with you to find Guangzong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. That Guangzong is very suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.85,0:11:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How does he know about Dr. Mei?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.08,0:11:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The only lead is with Guangzong; we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.80,0:11:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really going to ignore the fact that Xiao Mei is in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.43,0:11:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I will protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.93,0:12:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.18,0:12:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi’er.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.34,0:12:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t act rashly.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
